🚀 The feature, motivation and pitch
My team is working on adding custom backend for pytorch, and would like multiple streams backwards to be possible on privateuseone backend.
Specifically, part of the code in the autograd engine was hardcoded into CUDA without considering other accelerators similar to CUDA, resulting in other custom backends being unable to use multi-stream training.
